{"4890690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AVIK", "steam_appid": 4890690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4904170, 5033580], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/1bdc03eebfdc8ca5b9b0c23bde5820e3.avif?t=1787377287\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AVIK - An atmospheric space sandbox where you explore space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own spaceship - </strong>you can create any creation in the workshop, limited only by your imagination (and the laws of physics, of course :))</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/3802a12db7a9322300193c0d5b5dbf91.avif?t=1787377287\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle other ships - </strong>use a variety of weapons, from a contact drill to a high-tech railgun, to combat space pirates, enemy clans, and simply to avoid getting stuck in outer space because of a few asteroids.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/965ced4bbac1ab2f1a70b96d669c0a14.avif?t=1787377287\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine resources and craft new components - </strong>you have an endless supply of asteroids full of various resources at your disposal, which will help you craft the components you need to upgrade your ship. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/90ab52d657dfc87876f1d8172a7c5fb5.avif?t=1787377287\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the vastness of the universe - </strong>thanks to infinite world generation, your possibilities are limitless. It's time to enjoy the cosmic views and embark on a journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/2122286120479365ab3dab3a288a9975.avif?t=1787377287\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/1bdc03eebfdc8ca5b9b0c23bde5820e3.avif?t=1787377287\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AVIK - An atmospheric space sandbox where you explore space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own spaceship - </strong>you can create any creation in the workshop, limited only by your imagination (and the laws of physics, of course :))</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4890690/extras/3802a12db7a9322300193c0d5b5dbf91.avif?t=1787377287\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle other ships - </strong>use a variety of weapons, from a contact drill to a high-tech railgun, to combat space pirates, enemy clans, and simply to avoid getting stuck in outer s